id "1983514f-2ffa-5869-bb28-86e01bbf3b65" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525989 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic secant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{4-4{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{4(1-{x}^{2})}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{2}\\int -\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525860 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162697" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\nCalculate $\\int \\frac{\\pi }{e-e{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x$ for $|x|>1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "57a29797-cc3e-5389-a7ab-86cc5d574268" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526022 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\pi }{e-e{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\pi }{e(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{e}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{e}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525950 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95764" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int (\\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}+{e}^{x/3})\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "614a8bd5-e8a9-58b1-931b-797f75dbf2a0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526026 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}+{e}^{x/3})\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {e}^{x/3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {e}^{x/3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+3{e}^{x/3}+C \\\\  & =3(-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+{e}^{x/3})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525937 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95818" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int \\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "719c2d52-6292-5d90-9bd8-199e2cf3d54d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526037 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic secant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\int -\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525897 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95829" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\nCalculate $\\int -\\frac{7x}{8x-8{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x$ for $|x|>1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "71d6f25e-3ed3-51ba-912e-8201182714bc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526038 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -\\frac{7x}{8x-8{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int -\\frac{7x}{8x(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int -\\frac{7}{8(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{8}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525934 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162689" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{9-9{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "87d24960-3146-517f-bb76-d6b48812abfc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526050 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic secant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{9-9{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{9(1-{x}^{2})}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9}}\\int -\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525964 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162696" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\nCalculate $\\int \\frac{5x}{4x-4{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x$ for $|x|>1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "95b5596f-d8f3-581f-b312-cc7a79146188" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526057 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{5x}{4x-4{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{5x}{4x(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{5}{4(1-{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525976 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162694" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\nCalculate $\\int -\\frac{2x}{{x}^{3}-x}\\,\\text{d}x$ for $|x|>1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "983bd6eb-5081-55a8-bed1-50ddec8a93e0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526058 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -\\frac{2x}{{x}^{3}-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int -\\frac{2x}{x({x}^{2}-1)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int -\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}-1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525927 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95763" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int (2{x}^{7}-\\frac{1}{8|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}})\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "cc8743fd-7076-5d8e-abc0-564ed537d53a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526079 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2{x}^{7}-\\frac{1}{8|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}})\\text{d}x & =\\int 2{x}^{7}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\frac{1}{8|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {x}^{7}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{8}\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{8}+\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{8}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525877 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95762" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int -\\frac{\\sqrt{e+1}}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d23d20e8-0932-5bfc-bc9a-09fcb1277d67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526081 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -\\frac{\\sqrt{e+1}}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{e+1}\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{e+1}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525917 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162676" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{|x|\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e89bfa66-6d9d-5430-9f05-5264fafe0111" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526091 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{|x|\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{|x|\\sqrt{2({x}^{2}+1)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525905 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162672" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int \\frac{3}{4|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f994b641-a060-5cc3-9273-f9e498c2b259" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526103 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{4|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{3}{4}\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186525856 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95823" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int ({e}^{x/4}+\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fdc2c42a-a78e-544f-8c57-a29a8369b036" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186526105 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\nThe formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic secant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({e}^{x/4}+\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{x/4}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {e}^{x/4}-2\\int -\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{e}^{x/4}-2\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x+C \\\\  & =2(2{e}^{x/4}-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
